Gallery component licenses
==========================

The gallery contains components with separate licenses. The repository's
Apache License 2.0 does not replace these component licenses.

Gallery integration code outside src/runtime/classic follows the upstream
Apache License 2.0, available in the repository's root license file and in the
deployed site's /LICENSE file.

The classic OpenSCAD compatibility adapter retains code from the original
@taucad/openscad package, licensed GPL-2.0-or-later. Its license text and source
provenance are in src/runtime/classic/LICENSE and src/runtime/classic/NOTICE.md.
The unchanged openscad-wasm-prebuilt@1.2.0 engine also declares
GPL-2.0-or-later and supplies its own COPYING file.

The pinned Geist Regular and Bold font files use the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Their copyright and license are in src/runtime/classic/fonts/OFL.txt.

Bundled model sources, assets and BOSL2 retain their own licenses and attribution
under models/. Other dependencies retain the licenses supplied by their owners.

The deployed gallery provides the OpenSCAD notices and license files at:
  /licenses/openscad/NOTICE.md
  /licenses/openscad/LICENSE
  /licenses/openscad/ENGINE-COPYING.txt
  /licenses/openscad/fonts/OFL.txt

Source: https://github.com/ahzs645/tau/tree/main/apps/gallery
